<title>LEBANON: Lebanon foreign debt reaches $1.829 bln in Feb.</title>
<headline>Lebanon foreign debt reaches $1.829 bln in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's foreign debt rose slightly to $1,829 million in February from $1,822 million in January, the Bank of Lebanon said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Net total public debt rose to 16,913 billion pounds in February from 16,471 billion pounds in January, registering an annual growth of 39.20 percent, the Bank added.</p>
<p>The bank issued the following public debt details:</p>
<p>		Domestic	Net Domestic   Foreign debt</p>
<p>	   Debt (LBP blns)  Debt (LBP bln)    (US$) 1997 Jan</p>
<p>17,942 13,647 1,822 Feb 18,335 14,079 1,829 1996 Jan 12,447 9,614 1,305 Feb 12,537 10,032 1,334</p>
<p>($1 = 1,547.75 Lebanese pounds at end of February)</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 345723 345740 745308 745309</p>
</text>
